                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Two major issues with this game. The game controller support doesn't work. While the Steam page and game itself CLAIMS to have full controller support for an Xbox controller, right down to showing the control layout for gamepad at the very start of the game, there is no functionality from my Xbox controller for this game. While this probably isn't a concern for those who are accustomed to keyboard controls, but for somebody like me who struggles with keyboard gameplay, this is a real problem. The other issue, game is in desperate need of a tutorial stage that help explain how the game is played for those walking to experience blind. The only way I finally learned what I was supposed to do was watching the video provided here on this page.",
